bounty-description-salvage-skm = We need samples of SKM-24 or SKM-28 rifles. Send us three for inspection.
bounty-description-salvage-vodkizine = The board of directors demand a quality drink to toast with during their next quarterly reports meeting, make sure you don't spill it!
bounty-description-salvage-akms = We've been contracted to acquire high powered soviet weapons for a less-than-legal operation. Don't ask questions, just get the guns.
bounty-description-salvage-dragon = Our Iron Chef is requesting a more exotic cut of meat than normal xenos can supply, don't let it bite you first.
bounty-description-salvage-cloning = Loss Prevention needs cloning components to replace a client who recently disappeared.
bounty-description-salvage-keg = The Annual cost cutting meeting is soon, and they need a proper drink supply.
bounty-description-salvage-weapons = Research data on the Finka and Mosin recently were all mysteriously destroyed. Grab some samples so we can get that information back.
bounty-description-salvage-mop = The custodial team has been overwhelmed by the messes on stations and shuttles. Find them an advanced mop!
bounty-description-salvage-protolathe = A local Vulcan production center is missing a core piece of tech to be able to produce more modkits. Help them help us!

